WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.310
Gum-Gum...

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.650
What do you mean by that?

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.980
Please reduce it to a week.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:08.980
Don't mess with me!

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:14.260
You could've eaten it if you took
that bug out, couldn't you?

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:19.670
It took three full days to cook it,
skimming the scum...

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:24.010
I'm a customer! I'm paying you!

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:28.340
Can money... satisfy your hunger?

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:29.340
What'd you say?!

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:34.480
I'm asking, "Can it...
satisfy your hunger?!"

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:42.590
<i>"Unwelcome Customer!
Sanji's Food and Ghin's Debt."</i>

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.460
I can't... hold it anymore...

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:52.370
Serving customers! That is "love!"
And "love" means "restaurant!"

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.700
The customer is king!!

00:02:55.700 --> 00:03:01.640
Motto! Motto! Service motto!
Service is about pleasant greetings!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:04.150
Welcome, ya damn crook.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:05.650
Please never come back.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.650
I'm terribly sorry.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:09.150
Ten thousand berries coming in!

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.140
You look pathetic!

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:17.660
All right! I took a healthy dump,
and I'm in excellent shape again today!

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:20.660
Oh? Welcome, ya damn crook.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:25.000
Motto! Motto! Service motto!
The customer is...

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.670
Ahh! Our customer...

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.670
You again, Sanji! What're you
doing to our customer?!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:36.170
Of all people,
he's a Navy Lieutenant!

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.850
What is it, you damn cook?!

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:43.020
Don't call my name as
if I were your friend!

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:46.750
A damn cook has no right
to call me "damn cook!"

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:49.020
Restaurants can't exist
without customers!

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:53.030
Hurting our precious customer...
What do you think you're doing?!

00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:55.200
What's the big deal with customers?

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:00.530
He treated the food carelessly.
On top of that, he insulted cooks.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.800
So I taught him a lesson.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.650
What's with this restaurant...

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.980
No restaurant should treat
its customers like this...

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:22.320
I'll shut it down... I'll shut down
this restaurant! I'll shut it down!!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.830
I'll contact the government
immediately and...

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:29.490
Then I'd better finish you off here...

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.170
Stop it, Sous Chef!

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.000
--A stuck up asshole like you

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.340
--What're you doing?!
If you keep going at him,
--A stuck up asshole like you

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.000
--What're you doing?!
If you keep going at him,
--who's too big for his britches

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:36.340
--we'll be in a big trouble!
Stop it, Sanji!! Stop it!
--who's too big for his britches

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.570
--we'll be in a big trouble!
Stop it, Sanji!! Stop it!
--just pisses me off!!

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:41.440
--You're going too far, Sanji!
--just pisses me off!!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.840
So you think you're a big shot?! Huh?!

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.690
What happened?

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.020
Oh boy...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.020
What now?

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.850
What happened?

00:04:56.860 --> 00:04:58.690
Boy... that startled me...

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:01.460
O-Owner! What the heck are you doing?!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.630
Oh, dammit!! The ceiling
of my restaurant...

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:08.640
It's your fault, you brat!!

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.970
You broke it yourself!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.770
What're you doing, Owner?!

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:16.310
You can do that later,
please stop Sanji!!

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.310
Hey, Sanji!

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.750
Are you going on a rampage in
the restaurant again, you idiot?!

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.650
Shut up, you damn geezer!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.320
What'd you say?! Who do you
think you're talking to?!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:31.060
Are you trying to put my
restaurant out of business?!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.890
You brat!!

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:38.030
You, too! Get out of here already!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:48.680
<i>What's with this restaurant?
Even the owner is like a gangster...</i>

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.680
<i>It's as if... as if...
this were a pirate ship!</i>

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.680
You listen! The customer is king!

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:59.690
Just those who eat your
damn crappy dishes.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:04.630
Patty, Sanji! If you wanna fight,
do it in the kitchen!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.630
<i>Are these idiots really cooks?</i>

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.000
L-Lieutenant! Lieutenant Fullbody!

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:15.470
W-we've got trouble!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.810
Geez... what a wild restaurant...

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:21.580
Pirate Krieg's underling escaped!

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.710
What?!

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:28.080
After seven of us finally captured him
to get a lead on the Krieg Pirates...

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:32.990
Can't be! When we captured him
three days ago, he was close to starving!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.660
And we haven't fed him at all since!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.660
K-Krieg Pirates...

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:44.270
They're the ones who're said to be
the strongest pirates in the East Blue...

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.360
I'm very...

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.680
We have a new customer.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:05.220
He'd better not be someone who'll
go on a rampage in my place.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.880
A pirate, huh?

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:23.560
Anything's fine. Bring me food.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:27.980
This is a restaurant, right?

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.310
Welcome, ya damn crook.

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:35.820
I'll say it only one more time,
so listen good. Bring me food.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.820
That cook is gonna get killed...

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:42.810
Uhm, sir, I'm terribly sorry,
but do you have money for that?

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:48.000
Would a bullet do?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.830
So you don't have money, right?

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:51.670
What?!

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:54.340
Patty, that dumb ass!
He broke the chair...

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:56.000
What power!

00:07:57.670 --> 00:08:01.440
If you can't pay for the food,
you're not a customer.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.940
Good job, Cook!

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:07.110
<i>Beat that pirate up, Patty-san!</i>

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:10.950
Oh... Your stomach is grumbling, pirate.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:16.790
That was a fart, you stupid racoon dog.
Just bring me food.

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.780
If you're not a customer,
beat it already!!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:38.280
I-I've had enough already!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.980
I don't want anything
to do with this restaurant!

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.640
I-I'll never come back here!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:53.980
Now, dumb customers,
please continue your meal!

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:01.270
Please never come back. Hmph!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.610
Dammit! If I were in a normal state,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:12.100
I wouldn't have been...
mocked by someone like that...

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:16.620
Hey, are you hungry by any chance?

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:20.450
Shut up! I'm not hungry!

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:32.960
Eat it.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.310
Shut up! Beat it!

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:42.310
Even when I'm down and out,
I won't take charity from others.

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.970
Take this food away now!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:48.720
Stop whining and eat it already!

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.490
To me, anyone who's
hungry is a customer.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:55.650
Sorry, but I'm not a customer.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.670
How large and cruel the ocean is...

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:11.040
How scary it is to lose
food and water on the ocean...

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:13.530
How hard it is...

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:19.680
I can understand how a hungry
person feels more than anyone.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.020
You can die for your pride if you want,

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:26.350
but if you eat and survive, don't you
think there's a future for you?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.020
Sorry...

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:47.140
Sorry... Thank you...
I thought I'd die.

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:49.470
I thought I was done...

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.380
Delicious... Delicious...

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.380
I've never eaten food so delicious.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.660
It's damn delicious, isn't it?

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.170
I found a good cook!

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:16.000
Hey you, it's a good thing
that he gave you food!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.840
You almost died!

00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:21.480
Hey you, cook! Join my group!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.740
Huh?

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.680
Be the cook on my pirate ship!

00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:26.980
--Huh?!
--Huh?!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:44.200
Are you a pirate?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.370
Yep!

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:49.700
Why the hell did you shoot
a cannonball into this restaurant?

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.470
That was an accident!
A self-defense, stray shot.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:55.710
A what now?

00:11:55.710 --> 00:12:00.050
In any event, don't do anything
stupid to this restaurant.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:03.980
The owner of this place used to be
a cook in a famous pirate group.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:08.660
I see... So pops was a pirate...

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:13.990
To that damn geezer, this restaurant
is like his treasure...

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:18.000
On top of that, those cooks,
who came here out of admiration for him,

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.340
are all hot-headed just like pirates.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:27.340
Well, they're actually perfect for
this place since pirates come and go.

00:12:27.340 --> 00:12:31.010
Yeah, this restaurant is really wild.

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:34.010
Yeah. This is how it is here every day.

00:12:34.010 --> 00:12:39.120
There're even customers who come to see
fights between cooks and pirates these days.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:44.360
Because of that, the waiters
all got scared and ran away.

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:49.760
Ah, I see... That's why pops
told me to work here for a year...

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:52.030
Hey, join our group.

00:12:52.030 --> 00:12:58.040
I refuse. There's a reason that
I have to work in this restaurant.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.770
No! I refuse!

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:02.140
Wh-what do you mean?!

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.310
I refuse your refusal!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:09.650
You're a good cook,
so let's be pirates together.

00:13:09.650 --> 00:13:11.990
Hey, listen to what I say.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.990
So what's that reason?

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.320
I don't need to tell you.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.330
Huh? You just told me
to listen to what you say!

00:13:18.330 --> 00:13:22.330
I'm telling you
to accept what I say!

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.330
I'm gonna cut you into three pieces,
you damn straw hat!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:28.000
What'd you say?!
I'm gonna beat you up

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.740
if you make fun of
the straw hat, you jerkwad!

00:13:30.740 --> 00:13:33.010
Sorry to interrupt...

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.010
--What?!
--What?!

00:13:34.010 --> 00:13:38.350
I'm Ghin of the Krieg Pirates.

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:42.580
You're a pirate, too, right?
Do you have any goals?

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:47.250
I'm aiming for the One Piece.
I'm going to enter the Grand Line.

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:56.700
Given that you're looking for a cook,
it seems you have only a few members.

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:58.700
Yep. He's the fifth member.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.700
Why are you counting me?!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:04.640
Since you seem like
a nice guy, I'll warn you.

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:07.310
The Grand Line is the one
place you should avoid.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:10.810
You're still young.
You don't need to rush.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:14.310
The Grand Line is only a small
portion of the entire ocean.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:18.820
If you wanna be a pirate,
there's an endless ocean out there.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:23.990
I see... You know something
about the Grand Line?

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:28.660
No... I don't know anything...
I don't understand anything about it...

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:31.730
That's exactly why I fear it...

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:35.670
You're an underling of that Krieg,
and yet you talk so wimpy...

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:38.140
Hmm? Who's Krieg?

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.010
The hors d'oeuvre for
table 3 is ready!

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:51.040
Take it yourself.
We don't have any waiters.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.020
Is it really okay, though, Patty?

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:57.290
Is what okay?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.590
I hear the guy you beat up
earlier in the restaurant

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:03.630
is one of the Krieg Pirates.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.300
Oh yeah, I heard.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.300
"Don Krieg" is the strongest
and most evil pirate

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.970
in this part of the ocean.

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.140
That's right.

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.300
Hmm?

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:20.810
After all, he's the don
of a pirate fleet

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:25.840
that controls the captains
of 50 pirate ships.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.820
He's no less than a monster...

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:33.760
So, what's the big deal?

00:15:33.760 --> 00:15:38.320
I heard that his extraordinary force
consists of more than 5000 pirates.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:42.640
For example, if that guy from earlier

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:47.840
told Don Krieg what
happened to him here,

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:51.340
this restaurant will
probably be crushed

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:54.680
like a large parade of
elephants stomping on ants.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.850
Oh, yeah?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:02.290
Then you're saying that
I should've just treated him?

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.780
That's rude to the other customers.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.630
It will ruin the reputation
of the famous fighting cooks

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:15.070
at the Sea Restaurant Baratie!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:20.640
How many pirates do you
think we've beaten off?

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:23.310
If you're that scared, just quit!

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.280
What'd you say?!
Oh yeah, all the waiters

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:28.750
quit because of those words of yours!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.990
Patty! It's your fault
that we're this busy!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:37.990
Ha! Those wimps were
useless from the start!

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:38.990
Go for it!

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:40.330
Carne, take him out!

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:43.160
Patty, beat him!

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:46.770
Hey, you idiots!
Get to work already!

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:48.600
Yes, Owner!

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:51.670
So long then...

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:54.340
But I'm still going to the Grand Line.

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:57.680
Yeah. Do whatever you like.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:01.010
I'm a stranger to you. I don't have
the right to try to stop you.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:04.280
I just wanted to warn you.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:08.290
<i>And Sanji-san, thank you so much!</i>

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:13.290
I own my life to you. The food you
gave me was the most delicious.

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.630
Is it okay if I come back for it?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.060
Any time!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.970
Hey you, chore boy!

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:20.300
Ugh!

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:21.300
Pops!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.630
There you are!

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:30.310
Go, Ghin.

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.050
Ahh, sorry.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:36.320
You're gonna get yelled at,
because you fed me free, right?

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.310
Well...

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:51.330
there's no proof so there's no
reason for me to be yelled at.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:02.940
Don't ever get caught again, Ghin!

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:05.450
<i>Thank you, Sanji-san!</i>

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:08.710
I'll never forget your kindness!

00:18:10.280 --> 00:18:14.620
Sanji! Chore boy!
Get to work already!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:20.590
Hey, table 3 is ready!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.000
I'm Luffy!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.770
I'll be the chore boy from now.
Nice to meet you all!

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:45.650
Isn't the desert for table 6 ready yet?!

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:48.990
Hey, who's responsible for that order?!

00:18:48.990 --> 00:18:50.320
Isn't that you?!

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.660
I'm too busy right now!

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.330
That's because you keep spacing out!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.990
What'd you say?! Wanna fight?!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.940
If you have nothing to do,
wash dishes or something,

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.600
chore boy!

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.610
Where's Sanji?

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:07.610
He's hitting on a customer
in the dinning room.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:08.780
Again?!

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:14.280
I'm already annoyed by him just
being the Sous Chef to begin with!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:18.950
It can't be helped since he's
worked here the longest.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.120
Do you know why he
keeps staying here

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:24.620
when he doesn't get
along with Owner?

00:19:24.620 --> 00:19:27.130
He's aiming to be
the next Head Chef.

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.460
You can tell if you watch him.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:33.960
--Huh?
--Huh?

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:36.900
Hey, chore boy!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.310
How many dishes have
you broken so far?!

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:43.310
Oh, sorry. I forgot to count.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:46.980
That's not what I meant!
Apologize for breaking them!

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.820
Forget about washing dishes.
Clean that area!

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.310
Okay, leave it to me!

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:55.660
Don't take food!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:58.660
That's a main dish!!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.330
Oh, don't worry about it!

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.160
Ouch!!

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.330
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:08.330
Would you get out
of the kitchen already?!

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:11.340
You go take orders, okay?

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:15.180
Go ask what customers want to eat!
You can do it, can't you?!

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:16.680
Yes...

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.680
Chores're sure tiring. It must've
been a lot of work for Koby, too.

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:22.680
Hey, chore boy!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.680
Ugh! You guys...

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:27.350
I hear you have to work
for a year here!

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.620
Is it okay if we redraw
our flag for the ship?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:34.430
Ahhh... You're eating
yummy food without me?!

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:36.360
How could you?!

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:39.530
That's our business, right guys?

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.700
Take this!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:45.110
Y-yeah...

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:48.540
Well, it's true that
the food here is good.

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:55.050
I feel bad for you, but...

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:57.380
drink it yourself!

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:04.660
<i>--I can't believe you did that!
--I can't believe you did that!</i>

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.720
My stomach hurts!
That was nasty!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:19.330
How noisy...
Could they be his buddies?

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.010
Do it yourself.

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:29.020
Oh, dear ocean!

00:21:29.020 --> 00:21:31.020
I thank you for today's encounter!

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:32.020
What?!

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:38.360
Oh, love, I can't bear this hardship.
Go ahead and laugh at me.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:45.360
I'm now prepared to be a lowly
pirate or devil if I'm with you!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:52.710
However, how tragic it is!
There's too great an obstacle between us!

00:21:52.710 --> 00:21:57.040
That obstacle is me, right, Sanji?

00:21:57.040 --> 00:21:58.380
Damn geezer!

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:03.980
This is a good opportunity. Why don't
you become a pirate with them?

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:07.480
You're no longer needed
at this restaurant!

00:22:22.740 --> 00:22:24.700
I see...

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:28.070
That cook saved your life,

00:22:28.070 --> 00:22:30.680
and you were able
to come back here...

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:34.010
Is that what you're saying, Ghin?

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:37.880
Y-yes... B-but...

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:41.690
I never imagined the main ship
was in this condition...

00:22:41.690 --> 00:22:43.360
Don Krieg!

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:45.350
What?

00:22:47.030 --> 00:22:51.520
I'll take you there...
to the Sea Restaurant Baratie...

00:22:56.140 --> 00:23:06.130
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:37.070
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
